d="000000001B9FF840" style="padding: 0mm;"><table class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="600" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B7B11E0" style="width: 450pt;"><tbody><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9FC300" style="height: 22.5pt;"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9FC690" style="padding: 0mm; height: 22.5pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9FB630" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9FFD00" style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9F4C20" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9FBAF0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">&nbsp;</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9F4E80" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9FA7F0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Dear Agency Partner,<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014525370"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9F99F0">Thank you for your patience while we continue to investigate your query.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9F98E0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B7A3FA0">This is an update to let you know that our teams are still investigating and as soon as we hear further, we will let you know.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000001452B4C0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002A45F6F0"><mark data_liveedit_tagid="000000002A468C10">Optional</mark><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002A45F5E0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002A45F290"><mark data_liveedit_tagid="000000002A468F60">In the meantime, please continue to liaisewith your respective Technology Partner.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002A45EB40"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002A45EA30">If travel is imminent, please contact your local Qantas Agency Connect team who will be able to assist you with any servicing required.</mark><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002A45E920"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002A45E200">Thank you again for contacting us via the Qantas Agency Connect Contact Us form. We will be in touch shortly.<br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002588BED0"><br data_liveedit_tagid="000000002A45E0F0"></span><span data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014522850" style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9FACB0"></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9F39C0" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9FD710" style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);">Kind regards,<br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014B2D910"><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014B2DA20"></span><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9FD5E0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><b data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9F84B0">Qantas NDC Escalation Support</b><br data_liveedit_tagid="0000000014B2DB30"><em data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9F63C0">Qantas Airways Limited</em></span><span data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9FCDB0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(102, 102, 102);"><o:p data_liveedit_tagid="0000000022445560"></o:p></span></p></td></tr><tr data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9F5B70" style="height: 15pt;"><td valign="top" data_liveedit_tagid="000000001B9F5CA0" style="padding: 0mm; height: 15pt;"><p class="MsoNormal" data_liveedit_tagid="0000000025BB1D70" style="margin: 0mm; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; line-height: 15pt;"><span data_liveedit_tagid="00000000209A1FD0" style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: